      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is incredibly compassionate of you to notice how much your family is struggling, and that awareness shows how much you care about them. However, true kindness sometimes involves accepting the help you need so that everyone can be healthier in the long run. Instead of viewing needing support as selfish, try reframing it as an act of self-preservation that allows you to eventually be less of a strain. Small steps toward getting support can alleviate the pressure on everyone involved.",
      "source": "target",
