      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are in a deeply painful place where you feel like your worth is tied to the burden you place on others. Please know that your presence is valuable, and those feelings of being a drain are a reflection of your current suffering, not your true worth. If these thoughts of wanting to disappear or stop being here are becoming persistent, reaching out to a crisis line or mental health professional immediately is the most important step. They can provide immediate, confidential support to help you through this intense pain.",
      "source": "target",
